{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年8月25日 10:57 星期二</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>天文台發出特別天氣提示：一個雷雨區正影響本港，預料初時雨勢較大及局部地區有狂風雷暴。市民請保持警惕。（天文台）</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T03:20:26.644619+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none"}}